<p>We all know that every <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">class</code> in Objective-C inherits from <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">NSObject</code>, and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">NSObject</code> has methods like <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">init:</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">dealloc:</code>.</p>

<div class="language-objc highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><!-- <td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
