<h4 id="arsession--key-introduction">ARSession — Key Introduction</h4>

<p><img src="/assets/images/20170830ARKit/SessionBridge.avif" alt="Session Bridge" /></p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ARSession</code> is a bridge connecting the low level and the AR view. All the methods in <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ARSCNView</code> are provided by <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ARSession</code>.</p>

